Circuit-level noise: locations, faults, one rate per location type\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"0cad16aa-0a89-b805-3452-8ff4af3d0b6f"], 
    Cell["Book \[Section]10.1.1, Definitions 10.1\[Dash]10.3", "TableText",
